<<include"Ben NPC Character Menu Avatar Display">>

<<if $BenSocial > 50>>
    Ben Fischer is your friend and classmate. He is a bit nerdy; short, glasses, and the strength of a first grader; but is also very friendly and knowledgeable about everything from school subjects to obscure sci-fi facts. He enjoys reading and, despite getting flustered around you easily, seems to really enjoy your company. <br>
    <br>
<<elseif $BenSocial > -10>>
    Ben Fischer is your classmate and the local nerd of Preston. Short, glasses, the inability to fight back, all the classic traits of one. Though despite the bullying and his clear nervousness around anything even remotely threatening, he tends to keep up a positive attitude. He gets good grades and often spends his free time reading or daydreaming. <br>
    <br>
<<else>>
    Ben Fischer is your nerdy classmate. He has the strength of a toddler and the height of a 3rd grader, making him a prime target for bullies or just anyone who wants to let off some steam. He is nervous around anything that moves faster than a slug and often jumps at the sight of you. The only thing he has going for him is his grades and he often spends his spare time reading like the dork he is. <br>
    <br>
<</if>>

<<if $CompletedQuests.includes("Ben: Track Meet Cute")>>
    You met Ben’s overbearing and slightly eccentric family at a High School track meet. He lives with his parents, an old fashioned but well-meaning mother and military father, his younger brother, a hyperactive ball of energy the complete opposite of Ben, his older brother you’ve yet to properly meet, and his veteran grandfather. They seemed nice, though vastly different from the quiet and timid boy you know. <br>
    <br>
<</if>>

